{title: Bohot Shukriya}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi O P Nayyar Asha Bhosle}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E]Bahut shukri [A]ya badi meher [E]bani,        Meri zin [G]dagi [D]me [A]hujur aap aaye
[A]Kadam chum lu ya Ke aankhe [E]bicha du,        Karun kya ye [G]meri [D]Samaj me na [A]aaye
Bahut shukriya,        [A]Karun pesh tum ko [G]Najarana [A]dil ka
[A]Najarana dil ka,        [A]Ke ban jaye [G]Koyi afasana [A]dil ka
[D]Khuda jane aisi Suhani ghadi [G]phir,        [D]Khuda jane aisi Suhani [A]ghadi [E]phir
Meri zind [G]agi [D]me [A]Palat ke na aaye,        [E]Bahut shukri [A]ya...
[A]Khushi toh bahut hai,        [G]Magar yeh bhi [A]gam hai
[A]Magar yeh bhi gam hai,        [A]Ke ye sath [G]apna Kadam do [A]kadam hai
[D]Magar yeh musafir Duwa mangta [G]hai,        [D]Magar yeh musafir [A]Duwa mangta [E]hai
Khuda aap [G]se [D]phir [A]Kisi din milaye,        [E]Bahut shukri [A]ya...
[A]Mujeh dar hai mujh,        [G]Me gurur aana [A]jaye
[A]Lagu jhumne [G]me Surur aa [A]na jaye,        [A]Surur aa na jaye
[D]Kahi dil na mera Ye tarif [G]sun [D]kar,        [D]Kahi dil na mera [A]Yeh tarif [E]sun kar
Tumhare [G]bane [D]Aur [A]mujeh bhul jaye,        [E]Bahut shukri [A]ya...
